<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81286" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strip off</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ περίδῡσε χιτῶνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.100
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν αὐλητρίδων τὰἱμάτια περιέδυεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					13.607f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.acc.pers.,
				<i>strip</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ μὴ ἔφθησαν περιδύσαντες αὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.2.5
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰ νεκρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					5.68
				</span></i>
			, etc. : metaph., <i>deprive of</i> authority, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				13.15.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. acc. pers.
			et rei, <i>strip</i> one <i>of</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὰ [ποιήματα] περιδύσας τὸ μέτρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					[254]
				</span></i>
			 (dub.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ λοιπὰ π. τινάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					5.67
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτὸν τὴν ἐσθῆτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					6.11.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> c.acc. et
			gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν ναὸν τῶν
			ἀναθημάτων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.12.3
			</span></i>.</div>
